+Create a Checkout Session using one of the [prices you created](https://docs.stripe.com/payments/managed-payments/set-up.md#create-product) as a line item. Set the `success_url` to the URLs of your success page and cancel page, if applicable. To enable Managed Payments, set [managed_payments[enabled]](https://docs.stripe.com/api/checkout/sessions/create.md#create_checkout_session-managed_payments-enabled) to `true`.
+
+#### Subscriptions
+
+To create a Checkout Session for your subscription, set the `mode` to `subscription`.
+
+```curl
+curl https://api.stripe.com/v1/checkout/sessions \
+  -u "<<YOUR_SECRET_KEY>>:" \
+  -d "line_items[0][price]={{PRICE_ID}}" \
+  -d "line_items[0][quantity]=1" \
+  -d "managed_payments[enabled]=true" \
+  -d mode=subscription \
+  --data-urlencode "success_url=https://localhost:4242/success"
+```
+
+To disable Managed Payments for a specific Checkout Session, set [managed_payments[enabled]](https://docs.stripe.com/api/checkout/sessions/create.md#create_checkout_session-managed_payments-enabled) to `false`.
+
+#### One-time payments
+
+To create a Checkout Session to accept a one-time payment, set the `mode` to `payment`.
+
+```curl
+curl https://api.stripe.com/v1/checkout/sessions \
+  -u "<<YOUR_SECRET_KEY>>:" \
+  -d "line_items[0][price]={{PRICE_ID}}" \
+  -d "line_items[0][quantity]=1" \
+  -d "managed_payments[enabled]=true" \
+  -d mode=payment \
+  --data-urlencode "success_url=https://localhost:4242/success"
